<p>Hola <%= @invoice.client_name %>,</p>

<p>
  Adjuntamos la factura <strong><%= @invoice.number %></strong>
  (<%= number_to_currency(@invoice.total, unit: "€", format: "%n %u") %>, IVA incluido)
  correspondiente a su <%= @invoice.kind == Invoice::WEB ? "compra en la tienda online" : "pedido" %>.
</p>

<p>Gracias por confiar en PhoneRelax.</p>

<p>
  <%= @setting.legal_name %> · CIF <%= @setting.tax_id %><br>
  <%= @setting.full_address.split("\n").join(" · ") %><br>
  <%= [ @setting.phone, @setting.email ].compact_blank.join(" · ") %>
</p>
